# Capacitor native builds
#
# The android/ and ios/ project folders ARE committed: they carry the
# manifest, the entitlements and the signing config, and regenerating them
# would silently drop the App Links and push setup. Only build output and
# machine-local paths are ignored.
android/app/build/
android/build/
android/.gradle/
android/local.properties
android/app/release/
android/app/google-services.json
ios/App/Pods/
ios/App/build/
ios/App/App/GoogleService-Info.plist
*.keystore
*.jks
android/keystore.properties

# Signed build artefacts. This repository is public: a release bundle does not
# belong in it, and at 3.3MB each they would bloat every clone forever.
*.aab
*.apk

# Fundraising material. Carries the ask, the proposed terms and the valuation,
# which are nobody's business but ours and the people we hand it to.
LinkUpNaija-call-sheet.pdf
